{
  "_": "A recipe is the page a build starts from. `pages` says, for each page file, what it is for, the section kinds it may hold and the site fields those sections read. A pack gives, per page, the sections and variants the page starts with, for one of the contract's INDUSTRY_PACK ids; cleaning, legal and limousine start from service_business and change what their trade reads differently. The order is `layout` in src/site-config.ts, which the build edits: reorder, drop or change a variant, within `kinds` and the contract's SECTION_VARIANTS. A hero with no variant is the plain page hero (the home page takes its template's). Every section renders nothing until its fields are set, so a page with few facts is short rather than broken.",
